WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
1 / Open harshvardhanpareek.com
Choose Desktop downloads under CCTV Counter.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
2 / Choose Android
Select the Android tab to get the right file.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
3 / Download the file
Click Download Android APK. Wait for the download to finish.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
4 / Check the release status
Factory phone service must be running and reachable.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
After the APK finishes downloading:
1. Open the APK on your Android phone to install it.
2. Open Gate Desk Dev.
3. Enter your factory HTTPS address.
4. Tap Connect to factory, then sign in.
Factory phone service must be running and reachable.
